{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Task: Generate a completely new "Image with Text" section using native theme components. This design must use a "Full Width" container to maximize the website's margins, creating a premium, balanced, and high-end aesthetic.
    
    1. Dimensional Layout & Proportion (40/60 Split):
    
    Structure: 2-column horizontal split. The layout must be strictly divided into a 40% width for the Image column (LEFT) and a 60% width for the Content column (RIGHT).
    
    Container Sizing: Set the section to "Full Width" or "Extra Wide" to utilize the maximum available margins of the website.
    
    Mobile Behavior: Disable "Stack on mobile". Maintain this 40/60 horizontal split on all devices, including mobile screens, to ensure a compact and sleek presentation.
    
    Vertical Spacing: Apply zero (0) padding to the top and bottom of the section to keep it tightly integrated into the page.
    
    2. Image Optimization & Rounded Frame:
    
    Scaling: Use "Cover" or "Fill container" behavior for the image. It must occupy 100% of the vertical height of its 40% column without leaving any white gaps.
    
    Frame Style: Apply a maximum "Border-radius" to create a fully rounded or circular frame for the image. Ensure the image is perfectly centered within its left column.
    
    3. Centered Content (60% Column):
    
    Placement: All content inside the 60% right column must be perfectly CENTERED both vertically and horizontally.
    
    Subheading: "SOBRE MONETTA" (Uppercase, minimal sans-serif font).
    
    Heading: "TEXTO" (Large, premium serif font).
    
    Body Text: "Somos una marca comprometida con la excelencia y la autenticidad. Cada producto que creamos cuenta una historia de pasión, dedicación y atención al detalle." (Centered text alignment).
    
    4. Premium Interactive Buttons (Pill Shape):
    
    Configuration: Add two buttons: "MAS INFORMACIÓN" and "GRUPOS Y REFERENCIAS" directly below the text.
    
    Style: Use a "Pill" shape (fully rounded) with "Outline" / "Secondary" styling. Increase horizontal padding for an elegant, wider look.
    
    Overflow Protection: Position buttons side-by-side horizontally. If the column width becomes too narrow on mobile, force them to stack vertically while maintaining their centered alignment and premium rounded design.
    
    5. Visual Aesthetic Benchmark:
    
    Background: Solid Pure White (#FFFFFF).
    
    Aesthetic: High-end, minimalist, and perfectly symmetrical. The interface must feel fluid and clean, emulating the sophisticated UI of Apple product presentations.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-image-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-image-text-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: normal;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }};
    margin: 0 auto;
    gap: 0px;
  }

  .ai-image-text-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.image_width }}%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.image_padding }}px;
  }

.ai-image-text-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 80px;
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
}

.ai-image-text-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
}

.ai-image-text-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    /* Border-radius en la imagen directamente */
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
}

  .ai-image-text-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-image-text-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
  }

  .ai-image-text-content-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.content_width }}%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.content_padding }}px;
    text-align: center;
  }

.ai-image-text-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
  max-width: {{ block.settings.content_max_width }}px;
  border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
  border-radius: 80px;
  padding: 24px;
  background-color: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: -8px 0 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 10;
}

.ai-image-text-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
  box-shadow: -12px 0 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

.ai-image-text-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

.ai-image-text-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

  .ai-image-text-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subheading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subheading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subheading_letter_spacing }}px;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.subheading_margin }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-image-text-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_margin }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-image-text-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.body_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_color }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.body_line_height }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.body_margin }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-image-text-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: {{ block.settings.button_gap }}px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-image-text-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.button_text_transform }};
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-image-text-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_border_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-image-text-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.stack_on_mobile %}
        flex-direction: column;
      {% else %}
        flex-direction: row;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-image-text-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.stack_on_mobile %}
        width: 100%;
      {% else %}
        width: {{ block.settings.image_width }}%;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-image-text-content-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.stack_on_mobile %}
        width: 100%;
      {% else %}
        width: {{ block.settings.content_width }}%;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-image-text-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.body_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-image-text-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.stack_buttons_mobile %}
        flex-direction: column;
        width: 100%;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-image-text-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.stack_buttons_mobile %}
        width: 100%;
      {% endif %}
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-image-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-image-text-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-image-text-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-image-text-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-image-text-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-image-text-content-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-image-text-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <div class="ai-image-text-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.subheading }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-image-text-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.body_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-image-text-body-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.body_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.button_1_text != blank or block.settings.button_2_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-image-text-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.button_1_text != blank %}
              <a
                href="{{ block.settings.button_1_link }}"
                class="ai-image-text-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
                {{ block.settings.button_1_text }}
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.button_2_text != blank %}
              <a
                href="{{ block.settings.button_2_link }}"
                class="ai-image-text-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
                {{ block.settings.button_2_text }}
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

